---
title: Weekend Brunch
servings: 2
tags: [breakfast, eggs]
---
-- Serve warm

Whisk @eggs{4} with @milk{100%ml} and @?chives{1%tbsp;finely chopped}.
Season with @salt{=1%pinch} and @pepper.

Melt @butter{1 1/2%tbsp} in a #frying pan{} and add the eggs. [- low heat -]
Stir for ~{3-4%minutes} until just set.

Toast @bread{4%slices} and serve with @?smoked salmon{100%g} on a #?warm plate{}.
